<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index rises 15.2 points to 880.8.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index rises 15.2 points to 880.8.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, rose 15.2 points on Friday to 880.8 points, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>All of the ten sectoral indices rose, with the banking index rising the most, up 30.6 points to 1,276.9.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
